        "commit_message": "Follow up to\nhttps://github.com/cython/cython/commit/3c2bc9c6bb37f1dfd305256fab2977246f41ee61\n\nI maintain a couple projects where we set `Py_LIMITED_API` with\nalmost-full accuracy (performed with `sys.hexversion & 0xFFFF00F0`), and\nthat commit broke builds because the release level is masked, but I\ndon't see a good reason why it should be.",
