    "body": "Follow up to https://github.com/cython/cython/commit/3c2bc9c6bb37f1dfd305256fab2977246f41ee61\r\nI maintain a couple projects where we set `Py_LIMITED_API` with almost-full accuracy (performed with `sys.hexversion & 0xFFFF00F0`), and that commit broke builds because the release level is masked, but I don't see a good reason why it should be.\r\n\r\nfor context, here are some [example logs](https://github.com/h5py/h5py/actions/runs/29717968557) where a build fails for Python 3.14.6, which is definitely not in the future.",
    "closed_at": "2026-07-21T17:25:06Z",
    "comment_data": [
        {
            "_links": {
                "html": {
                    "href": "https://github.com/cython/cython/pull/7843#discussion_r3617493757"
                },
                "pull_request": {
                    "href": "https://api.github.com/repos/cython/cython/pulls/7843"
                },
                "self": {
                    "href": "https://api.github.com/repos/cython/cython/pulls/comments/3617493757"
                }
            },
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "I wonder if we should instead do `(Py_LIMITED_API & 0xFFFF0000) > (PY_VERSION_HEX & 0xFFFF0000)` as a better representation of the check we're really trying to do.  The last 4 digits don't meaningfully contribute but equally they don't seem to do any harm",
            "commit_id": "6f6501819b6b35c6a85e46a60426ab7780abe9e2",
            "created_at": "2026-07-20T20:54:20Z",
            "diff_hunk": "@@ -894,7 +894,7 @@ def generate_module_preamble(self, env, options, cimported_modules, metadata, co\n                    \"please install development version of Python.\")\n         code.putln(\"#elif PY_VERSION_HEX < 0x03090000\")\n         code.putln(\"    #error Cython requires Python 3.9+.\")\n-        code.putln(\"#elif defined(Py_LIMITED_API) && Py_LIMITED_API > (PY_VERSION_HEX & 0xFFFF0000)\")\n+        code.putln(\"#elif defined(Py_LIMITED_API) && Py_LIMITED_API > (PY_VERSION_HEX & 0xFFFF00FF)\")",
            "html_url": "https://github.com/cython/cython/pull/7843#discussion_r3617493757",
            "id": 3617493757,
            "line": null,
